s looked to influence the closing stages. Brighton thought they had added a fourth through Charalampos Kostoulas , but the goal was ruled out for offside. Even with a numerical disadvantage, the hosts controlled 73% of the possession, leaving the visitors chasing shadows. The match concluded with a deserved victory for Brighton , who managed the game expertly until the final whistle."
